  "duration_seconds": 97.13333333333334,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C01",
      "text": "手电光照在叉车轮子上。一个女人说，停。我抬头，看见她腰侧挂着一根短棍。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f4ae9429ee1b808991e13006f1c45e877e3152a8994ee81c1086db0ec9664136",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 240,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C02",
      "text": "她站得笔直，右手习惯性贴着腰侧，左耳后有一道浅疤。她说，这批货，没有报备单。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "901b815d0770adc62a0db6929d2a3da52c0040acf04d25da64bd565f7e7c392b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "start_frame": 243,
      "end_frame": 486,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C03",
      "text": "我把合同递过去。她看得很慢，没找到破绽，就抽出美工刀，划开一个纸箱，又划开一个。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "72fcf4635ef440be2e2cdc1f28cb3de7929c19a3f40b1d78c00514f0ab31d6e2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "start_frame": 489,
      "end_frame": 747,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C04",
      "text": "柴油，压缩饼干，种子，探照灯。她抬眼看我，说，这些东西放在一起，只有两种人，邪教，和准备打仗的。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1b7a9bd29713825dd334db58d8631b48f9a6ada107e9fab55a4353f97cd42a0b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "start_frame": 750,
      "end_frame": 1086,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C05",
      "text": "我说，我是前仓储主管。我囤的不是货，是命。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "88b595e1e15589448e0358e334846ff68e8a0ee4c9100fa9e51d792609064bf2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "start_frame": 1089,
      "end_frame": 1243,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C06",
      "text": "她握刀的手，停了半秒。她问，命？我说，三个月后，你就知道我说得对不对。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "420f2c9a6f98f4538c10fdf4d9ef5b97b936e04802a3e55db7a790b9c3589911",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "start_frame": 1246,
      "end_frame": 1471,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C07",
      "text": "她冷冷收刀。三个月后我还在这儿当保安。你要是骗我，我查你一辈子。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5716b7a563aa7479c7c7916dc0c11adf86e595ae102eac286872c48a4a1ef2f0",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.78025,
      "start_frame": 1474,
      "end_frame": 1678,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C08",
      "text": "补完资料，她在回执上签了名字，夏凛。字迹很重，像刀刻出来的。那时候，距离血月降临，还剩八十五天。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b5aaaae5bd5611dfcb074474b50add5927ade081193e6b9cd20a5f7a775a7b14",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "start_frame": 1681,
      "end_frame": 2005,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C09",
      "text": "卸货的时候，她一直站在叉车和人之间。我心想，仓里这么多东西，夜里是该有个这样认真的人。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "065b792bef985fa1698a6210daf28f57c976a652ef8ecdfc329b9bbbe7b51a5f",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "start_frame": 2008,
      "end_frame": 2266,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C10",
      "text": "凌晨，我去岗亭交副本。她正合上一本旧本子，页面上露出一笔转账，八千。我没问是给谁。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a6031ff41fe2a23aecd53bcbde40cc4ab79ad325c9dea64b4384e7e5f2003927",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.589844,
      "start_frame": 2269,
      "end_frame": 2557,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C11",
      "text": "她没抬头，把我的报备单压在窗口下，在新的一页，写下一个字。命。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3dcac072135541c42911e7f5e68e0ff6ba35b763d7de4876bc27d64be1ebd21b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "start_frame": 2560,
      "end_frame": 2758,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C12",
      "text": "她脖子上挂着一块旧狗牌，握着笔的指节，微微发白。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f5df40db0d9f0f9bac5a552ab077040e7f0261f4ffa17c573471c3242cf56546",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "start_frame": 2761,
      "end_frame": 2914,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    }
  ],
